{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50795","headline":"题池州杜员外弄水新亭 · 张祜","name":"题池州杜员外弄水新亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"广厦光奇辈，恢材卓不羣。\n夏天平岸水，春雨近山云。\n婉衍榱甍揭，端完柱石分。\n孤帆惊乍驻，一叶动初闻。\n晚槛余清景，凉轩啓碧氛。\n宾筵习主簿，诗版鲍参军。\n露洒新篁滴，风含秀落叶松薰。\n何劳思岘岭，虚望汉江滨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50795.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50795","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}